<title>USA: Rockwell unit in motor pact with Flender AG.</title>
<headline>Rockwell unit in motor pact with Flender AG.</headline>
<dateline>GREENVILLE, S.C. 1997-04-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rockwell Automation/DODGE, a unit of Rockwell International Corp and A. Friedrich Flender AG said they have formed an alliance for the development and manufacture of a gearmotor product line.</p>
<p>Financial details were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Flender AG, a member of the Deutsche Babcock Group, manufactures electronic, electrical, mechanical, and hydraulic components which are offered both individually and as partial or complete systems.</p>
<p>DODGE designs, manufactures, and supports industrial automation products.</p>
</text>
